name: Mathematical correction or audit finding
description: Report a precise proof gap, counterexample, scope error, or theorem-state inconsistency.
title: "Math: "
body:
  - type: markdown
    attributes:
      value: >-
        Read docs/STATE.md and the relevant target route first. Keep failed statements
        and exact regressions traceable; an issue reports a concern but does not itself
        alter canonical theorem status.
  - type: input
    id: claim
    attributes:
      label: Exact claim
      description: Give the theorem ID, statement, or file and section under review.
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: input
    id: base
    attributes:
      label: Commit and theorem state version
      description: Identify the exact repository version where the issue appears.
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    id: issue
    attributes:
      label: Precise objection or correction
      description: Point to the missing implication, false hypothesis, counterexample, or corrected statement.
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    id: evidence
    attributes:
      label: Evidence and reproduction
      description: Include a proof, exact construction, source passage, script, or commands sufficient to check the concern.
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    id: scope
    attributes:
      label: Scope and dependencies
      description: State which hypotheses fail, what downstream claims may depend on the issue, and what remains valid.
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    id: context
    attributes:
      label: Related work and limitations
      description: Link relevant PRs, audits, reports, or discussions. State what you have not checked.
    validations:
      required: true
